 conversation, addressing conservative treatment methods and follow-up instructions.\n   - Response B also provides evidence-based support for its assessment and plan, detailing medication use, physical therapy, and reasons for follow-ups in excellent agreement with typical medical guidance.\n   [RESULT] Tie\n\nBetter Response: B", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1732828016, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_7f6be3efb0", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 391, "prompt_tokens": 3356, "total_tokens": 3747, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


